notes: This is the identity problem. If I tell an agent to change page four, and the order has changed since the last version, page four is a different page. So every page has a stable Slide ID — the four-character code — separate from its Position. In this real footer the page moved from position two to position four; the ID stayed C014. That means I can ask for C014, and the history belongs to C014 no matter where it sits.
